TEXT 32 704 Left 2 ;Wien-bridge oscillator: f0 = 1/(2*pi*R*C) = 1.59 kHz with R1 = R2 = R and C1 = C2 = C\nNeeds a gain of 3: 1 + (R3 + R4)/Rg = 3.18 to start; D1 and D2 shunt R4 as the swing grows and hold the amplitude
TEXT 32 760 Left 2 ;DSIG is a generic small-signal diode (1N4148 class); .ic gives the ideal circuit the kick a real one gets from noise
